  "remarks": "TAi.071 Title: Maulavi. Designation: Deputy Minister for Finance under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Passport no: Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009871, issued on 06 Feb. 2022 in Kabul, Afghanistan (Name in Latin script: Najeebullah Hayat; expires on 6 Feb. 2027). Cousin of Moulavi Noor Jalal. National identification no.: Afghan national identification card (tazkira) number 545167, issued in 1974. Grandfather’s name is Salam. Taliban member responsible for Laghman Province as of late 2010.; Listing: Listed on 23 February 2001 (amended on 3 Sep 2003, 18 Jul. 2007, 21 Sep. and 27 Sep. 2007, 29 Nov. 2011, 16 May 2014, 10 Mar. 2026)",
